          "description": "The toys are back! And this time, they're facing their most formidable rival yet: technology.\n\nWhen Bonnie receives a brand-new tablet called Lilypad, her beloved toys find themselves competing for her attention like never before. Woody, Buzz, and Jessie must band together to take on this sleek, smart, and surprisingly charming new threat — before playtime disappears forever.  \n\nPacked with heart, fun, and the magic that has made Toy Story a timeless classic, this audio retelling in 10 short chapters brings the whole adventure to life!",
